{"about_the_game":"<strong> The Blue Stars</strong> is a strategy RPG where you can bond with weird alien party members.<br><br>It is inspired by Fire Emblem, Persona, Gain Ground and various other strange places.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2450090/extras/bbbafccede29c025d419dd57b6709952.apng?t=1753911889\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2450090/extras/bbbafccede29c025d419dd57b6709952.poster.avif?t=1753911889\" class=\"bb_img\" width=776 height=620 /></picture></span><br><br>You play as the Prince of Earth.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2450090/extras/210031b35c95101229e45f8601ed99cb.poster.avif?t=1753911889\" width=300 height=210 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2450090/extras/210031b35c95101229e45f8601ed99cb.webm?t=1753911889\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2450090/extras/210031b35c95101229e45f8601ed99cb.mp4?t=1753911889\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Earth has been conquered by an invading force called the Sarjonians.<br><br>After escaping the planet you set out to rescue your Father, the King of Earth himself, from an execution scheduled 6 days from now. <br><br>To prevail in your quest you must recruit and befriend aliens sympathetic to your cause.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2450090/extras/5dbc285c0fa55cb6b55d39968d5401ae.poster.avif?t=1753911889\" width=300 height=210 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2450090/extras/5dbc285c0fa55cb6b55d39968d5401ae.webm?t=1753911889\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2450090/extras/5dbc285c0fa55cb6b55d39968d5401ae.mp4?t=1753911889\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2450090/extras/c03f3e18577a238936e8e8e94e6d19e4.poster.avif?t=1753911889\" width=300 height=210 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2450090/extras/c03f3e18577a238936e8e8e94e6d19e4.webm?t=1753911889\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2450090/extras/c03f3e18577a238936e8e8e94e6d19e4.mp4?t=1753911889\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Features include simple yet constantly expanding strategy combat and anti social aliens.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2450090/extras/b364784b85bc526ef62b4e411fb862e3.poster.avif?t=1753911889\" width=300 height=210 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2450090/extras/b364784b85bc526ef62b4e411fb862e3.webm?t=1753911889\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2450090/extras/b364784b85bc526ef62b4e411fb862e3.mp4?t=1753911889\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2450090?t=1753911889","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2450090/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1753911889","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2450090/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753911889","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store